        content: `
          <p class="blog-p lead-p">The agents could go one step further and submit the applications for me, but is that really the right call?</p>
          <p class="blog-p">Recognising AI's strengths and weaknesses is half the battle when designing workflows that work.</p>
          
          <h3 class="blog-subheading">Where AI excels</h3>
          <ul class="blog-list">
            <li>Coding tasks and deterministic scripts</li>
            <li>Speed and continuous parsing</li>
            <li>Debugging structured errors</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="blog-subheading">Where AI falls short</h3>
          <ul class="blog-list">
            <li>Nuanced creativity and personal tone of voice</li>
            <li>Consistent, repeatable outputs across varying contexts</li>
            <li>Hallucination risks when left unconstrained</li>
