          <p class="blog-p">AI can be unpredictable and often wrong. Letting it represent me to an employer introduces risks I was not willing to accept, and there is every chance it could say something inaccurate or awkward.</p>
          <p class="blog-p">Having a human in the loop, where I can read over tailored CVs and check the AI's reasoning for each score, keeps the standard of applications high. Quality matters.</p>
